  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishing a UNIDO Subcontracting and Partnership Exchange Centre in Oman</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishing a Subcontracting Partnership Exchange (SPX) Centre in Oman; The project aims to support the Sultanate of Oman in the setting up of a Subcontracting and Partnership Exchange (SPX) Centre. The SPX Programme is being pursued in the context of the country needs in matters related to local content from main industries in the country and the overall goal of pursuing industrial development as a means with which to diversify the Omani economy.</narrative>
  </description>
